+```
+Phi*: k[x,y] -> k[gamma,gamma^(-1),pi]
+y |-> gamma^(-u),
+x |-> (gamma^(-u)-e-c(gamma)-gamma^v*pi)/b.
+F = Phi*(f), G = Phi*(g) in k[gamma,pi], by Prop. 6.3(1),
+deg_pi F = m' = um/d, deg_pi G = n' = un/d, by (2).
