+solve `F(T^(-1),pi)=xi` in Puiseux series in **T**. Then `y=T^u -> 0`.
+The formula `pi_i=(tau_i-c)/gamma^v` in the proof of Prop. 6.3 initially describes
+the principal cluster over `gamma=0`, where `y=infinity`. It is not already a
