+**The local rule, including the count.** Translate the child's formal root
+coordinate by its common centre, writing
+
+```
+h(T)=T^v (T^u-e-c(T^(-1))),
+w=pi-h(T)=-b T^v x=-b T^v/t,      t=x^(-1), y=T^u.
+```
