+The inverse-top zero reduced multiplicity is `7-1(4+1)=2`. In the centred
+child chart the pattern is `pi^2(pi-a)^4(pi-b)`. Translation of the leading
+coefficient variable gives the replay's normalized multiset `(4,2,1)`; such
